{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_012_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c271176a5362a5e78374a7d07e6683eb7808221e5f541fff12e8c589b930c798",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc0f85aaa75c81068f8673812fda53655e497ad78bbfaded93f3a1c9651972a2",
      "text": "能证明我们互相了解的事例可多啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c2470091d952562216ffee65de345139930b7d322cb2ef1642c2a53d6a764c",
      "text": "最近一次生日，我们送了彼此同款不同色的鞋子。\n那个时候真是惊呆了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048592ae7ce4ceabad4a6b9c9894dafa99d0be92c1b38475dbc412045b17ff3f",
      "text": "毕竟一开盒子，\n里面装着跟我送的完全一模一样的鞋子啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af998cec014fb4d31d183db0d30fd1c7f72edcb0affc30ed7695e7f4a5ba1247",
      "text": "我一愣，转头去看享介。\n发现那家伙果然也一脸惊讶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18286342e9016028b01ed4443655cb1510ad492aca4c83295af1b5944a61f12f",
      "text": "发现两个人想的都一样，我们俩直接大笑了起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbe7da1d65ee662b6a0dfd461b43ce4b3d369a2a6e98350fb7752fd0d40fde6b",
      "text": "眼前浮现出悠介先生和享介先生互动的画面了。\n真是令人愉快的平局呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cc9e0f8b8209e8095ae1d839ded2fa6006047b99a6b45f671ff561004600b99",
      "text": "虽然挺有趣的，但还是想赢啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfdb7cb1ebb625bc8efa180e9cf107c7d090111a6ef79e7b84f8b30e09019ba",
      "text": "大概就是这样，这种事情一直持续着，\n所以这次我真的很想赢一次啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
